141
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off!</font>

142
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast!</font>

143
00:11:42,810 --> 00:11:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay, Ranmaru?</font>

144
00:11:47,110 --> 00:11:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You stay here.</font>

145
00:11:49,030 --> 00:11:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take me with you.</font>

146
00:11:56,410 --> 00:11:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru.</font>

147
00:11:59,330 --> 00:12:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where'd you go, Ranmaru?</font>

148
00:12:09,170 --> 00:12:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...!
You're going to pay for this!</font>

149
00:12:15,390 --> 00:12:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art... Thunder Armor!</font>

150
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:22,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now...</font>

151
00:12:26,650 --> 00:12:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it!</font>

152
00:12:27,860 --> 00:12:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off!</font>

153
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go.</font>

154
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a heck of a blow.</font>

155
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:57,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I hadn't put on the Thunder Armor,
I'd be giving myself a funeral.</font>

156
00:13:04,140 --> 00:13:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to remember your hard work,
I'll give you your funeral myself!</font>

157
00:13:09,730 --> 00:13:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

158
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the idea?</font>

159
00:13:23,660 --> 00:13:27,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to feed you
the curry of life, too.</font>

160
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll realize that you're not alone
if you eat the curry.</font>

161
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's feelings are blended in.</font>

162
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:38,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

163
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's stop hurting people.</font>

164
00:13:41,850 --> 00:13:43,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut it out!</font>

165
00:13:44,770 --> 00:13:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're my eyes and ears.</font>

166
00:13:47,530 --> 00:13:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll no longer be two people in one
if you say such selfish things!</font>

167
00:13:53,650 --> 00:13:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot your lightning.</font>

168
00:13:56,340 --> 00:14:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I die, the strong Raiga will also die.
We're two in one, so...</font>

169
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:11,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... won't be able to remember you
from when you were cool.</font>

170
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must give you a funeral!</font>

171
00:14:23,350 --> 00:14:25,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Raiga!</font>

172
00:14:26,430 --> 00:14:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

173
00:14:37,990 --> 00:14:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are lots of Narutos.</font>

174
00:14:41,900 --> 00:14:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I get drunk?</font>

175
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...! It makes no difference,
no matter how many of you there are!</font>

176
00:14:57,900 --> 00:15:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, wake up!</font>

177
00:15:03,050 --> 00:15:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, Neji?</font>

178
00:15:08,230 --> 00:15:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this and get it together.
We've got trouble here.</font>

179
00:15:12,310 --> 00:15:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

180
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

181
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:22,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now we've done it.</font>

182
00:15:23,740 --> 00:15:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to kill by your own hand</font>

183
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the friend who risked his life
to save you?</font>

184
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...? Ranmaru betrayed me.</font>

185
00:15:32,330 --> 00:15:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He broke the promise for it
to be just us two forever.</font>

186
00:15:36,130 --> 00:15:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not all alone anymore.</font>

187
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:41,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He figured out that it's more fun</font>

188
00:15:41,470 --> 00:15:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to laugh with everyone
than to cry with you.</font>

189
00:15:46,970 --> 00:15:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

190
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru, you were going to die
with Raiga, weren't you?</font>

191
00:15:52,350 --> 00:15:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be thinking about
something like that anymore.</font>

192
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:56,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're free now.</font>

193
00:15:57,170 --> 00:16:01,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry. I won't let Raiga
give you a funeral, no matter what.</font>

194
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:05,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't be shooting off your mouth,
you shrimp.</font>

195
00:16:05,950 --> 00:16:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?</font>

196
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't underestimate me.
I'm Raiga Kurosuki!</font>

197
00:16:12,790 --> 00:16:17,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been counted before as one of
the Seven Ninja Swordsmen of the Mist.</font>

198
00:16:18,550 --> 00:16:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't take orders from
the likes of you!</font>

199
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:23,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right.
He's a Ninja Swordsman, huh?</font>

200
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:26,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're one of the
Seven Ninja Swordsmen of the Mist,</font>

201
00:16:26,850 --> 00:16:29,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then I've got something to ask you.</font>

202
00:16:29,850 --> 00:16:32,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know the guy called Kisame, right?</font>

203
00:16:33,350 --> 00:16:37,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kisame? I hate that guy.</font>

204
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:41,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I'll give him a funeral for sure
the next time I see him.</font>

205
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

206
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate him.</font>

207
00:16:44,930 --> 00:16:48,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate all the Seven Ninja Swordmen
of the Mist.</font>

208
00:16:49,870 --> 00:16:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru, you're the only one
who's a friend to me.</font>

209
00:16:56,750 --> 00:17:02,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, Ranmaru,
you've made other friends.</font>

210
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not two in one anymore.</font>

211
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga.</font>

212
00:17:16,140 --> 00:17:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impudent!</font>

213
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who do you think taught you
about the outside world?</font>

214
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:31,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a funeral for you!</font>

215
00:18:00,150 --> 00:18:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Spinning Axe Kick!</font>

216
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...</font>

217
00:18:07,570 --> 00:18:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone... Body Slam!</font>

218
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru...</font>

219
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now you're free.</font>

220
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:32,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga?</font>

221
00:18:37,140 --> 00:18:41,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thunder! Give me my funeral!</font>

222
00:19:14,090 --> 00:19:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two... One...</font>

223
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not loud enough!</font>

224
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You can't make genuine curry of life...
— One, two...</font>

225
00:19:23,470 --> 00:19:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— if you don't stir it with all your heart!
— One, two...</font>

226
00:19:24,770 --> 00:19:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my!</font>

227
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, Mom?</font>

228
00:19:30,990 --> 00:19:32,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my, Karashi!</font>

229
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a hundred years too soon for you
to be uttering the word "genuine"!</font>

230
00:19:38,290 --> 00:19:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too. Start your training over again
from the beginning!</font>

231
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

232
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:44,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho!</font>

233
00:19:46,130 --> 00:19:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be leaving now.</font>

234
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for your help.</font>

235
00:19:50,050 --> 00:19:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave Ranmaru to you.</font>

236
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my. I'll train him mercilessly
as a successor</font>

237
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the preparation of the curry of life.</font>

238
00:20:00,430 --> 00:20:03,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good luck, Ranmaru, Karashi.</font>

239
00:20:04,520 --> 00:20:05,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Thanks.
— Thanks.</font>

240
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:12,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my. It's a long way
to the Village Hidden in Leaves.</font>

241
00:20:13,030 --> 00:20:14,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I made you guys some special curry</font>

242
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:17,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that'll give you guys 10,000 times
the strength.</font>

243
00:20:17,450 --> 00:20:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be on your way after having some.</font>

244
00:20:24,330 --> 00:20:27,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this very spicy-looking
bright red color?</font>

245
00:20:27,790 --> 00:20:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It kind of hurts my eyes!</font>

246
00:20:31,670 --> 00:20:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That looks good!</font>

247
00:20:33,050 --> 00:20:34,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What? Seriously?
— What? Seriously?</font>

248
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}CURRY OF LIFE</b></font>

249
00:20:37,670 --> 00:20:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama will get mad at us
if we don't get back soon.</font>

250
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right!</font>

251
00:20:41,220 --> 00:20:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately, we'll have to be going now.</font>

252
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

253
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:55,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my, those kids were sure
bashful and reserved.</font>

254
00:20:58,750 --> 00:21:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The curry. The curry!</font>

255
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:30,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

256
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:30,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

257
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

258
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

259
00:21:41,630 --> 00:21:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

260
00:21:41,630 --> 00:21:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

261
00:21:52,420 --> 00:22:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

262
00:21:52,420 --> 00:22:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

263
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

264
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

265
00:22:16,280 --> 00:22:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

266
00:22:16,280 --> 00:22:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

267
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

268
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

269
00:22:38,570 --> 00:22:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">A captain's duty is to give prompt orders to his subordinates,</font>

270
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:45,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">protect everyone and complete the mission quickly.</font>

271
00:22:45,570 --> 00:22:48,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Woah! So cool!</font>

272
00:22:48,870 --> 00:22:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This is just perfect for me, Lord Naruto, who will eventually become Hokage.</font>

273
00:22:53,450 --> 00:22:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Alright! I'll get closer to becoming Hokage with this.</font>

274
00:22:58,040 --> 00:23:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Everyone Comes With Me! A Takurami Survival of Sweat and Tears!"</font>

